&lt;li&gt;Experience with tenders, technical specifications, proposals and negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage several opportunities and customer projects in parallel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent German and English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German and further languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning first customer projects into repeatable solutions or broader market opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with software and service business models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience in renewable energy or storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
